  "short_description": "Dark Souls即将推出极具话题性及代表性的系列新作。 作好准备，再次拥抱黑暗！",
  "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/374320/extras/7ff6b0ecb653bfafca61f79bd401a25d.poster.avif?t=1748630784\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/374320/extras/7ff6b0ecb653bfafca61f79bd401a25d.webm?t=1748630784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/374320/extras/7ff6b0ecb653bfafca61f79bd401a25d.mp4?t=1748630784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>─赢得gamescom 2015 &quot;&quot;Best RPG&quot;&quot; 奖项，以及于2015 E3展获得超过35项奖项及提名─<br><br>DARK SOULS™ III为即将推出，极具话题性及代表性的系列新作。<br><br>当火渐熄，世界趋于毁灭，您将再踏上面临更多磨难、大量敌人与难关的旅途。玩家将沉浸在史诗氛围的世界之中，感受更快速的游玩节奏与棘手的战斗强度带来的黑暗气息。不论新手或是老玩家，都将因著名的游戏体验、实境般的游戏画面为之着迷。<br>如今仅剩余火尚存……作好准备，再次拥抱黑暗！<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/374320/extras/b6d4d107eb7a5134984e711364fa4f2e.poster.avif?t=1748630784\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/374320/extras/b6d4d107eb7a5134984e711364fa4f2e.webm?t=1748630784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/374320/extras/b6d4d107eb7a5134984e711364fa4f2e.mp4?t=1748630784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
